  <item>
    <title>假唱，假演，假拍…娱乐明星划水大赏（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67338c2af373fe5d4dcc08e4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67338c2af373fe5d4dcc08e4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Nov 2024 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期内容，我们邀请嘉宾嘟嘟返场，狠狠爆料了内娱明星们令人叹为观止的划水和作弊行为。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从唱歌预录、拍照换头、表演替身，到“走过场”的媒体采访，“分猪肉”的颁奖典礼…...</span></p><span></span><p><span>不得不令人感叹，内娱确实是个巨大的草台班子啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>ps：本期分享内容，仅代表个人观点，上升不了任何立场，如有雷同，就当笑话听吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】嘟嘟</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="173">02:53</a> 半开麦、半真唱、预录，如何分辨明星是否假唱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">10:05</a> shout out to 现场“拉麦”表演的老师们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="949">15:49</a> 现场表演的时候，为什么要戴耳返？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1036">17:16</a> 瘦子亲历的一场知名乐队大型假弹现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1291">21:31</a> 某杂志呛声经纪人事件的观点分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1837">30:37</a> 拍大合影只p自己，这是明星的privilege吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a> 40%的微do，医美、整容或化妆，算是明星的“作弊”行为吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> “黑红也是红”，请把这句话写进成名教科书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 时尚圈辛密！拍杂志还能换头？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2611">43:31</a> 演员使用替身是一种划水行为吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 为什么“完美人设”越来越让人讨厌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2805">46:45</a> 媒体的“采访提纲”与明星的“参考回答”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3063">51:03</a> 我们为什么没有好看的颁奖典礼了</span></p>]]></description>
