    <title>双十一，奇葩算法给我推送了一坨翔</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671670f00d2f24f289ca1ddb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671670f00d2f24f289ca1ddb</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Oct 2024 04:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一年一度的双11来了，我们邀请性骚扰话题的嘉宾嘟嘟返场，一起聊了聊曾经在各大电商平台看到/买过的奇葩物品，以及真心推荐的实用好物（后附图）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在盘点了近30件或奇葩或智商税或真心好用的物品之后，我们感慨：</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然人类偶尔在赛博世界也难逃被算法骚扰的厄运，但关于幸福和方便的边界也好像因此一点点被拓宽了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家尽量避坑消费陷阱，花点小钱就能收获实在的快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ps：对“性骚扰”话题感兴趣的朋友，也欢迎关注我们，进入主页下滑到播客的第一期开始收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】：嘟嘟</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">01:47</a> 嘟嘟手机里令人瞠目结舌的算法推荐（假体 毛，硅胶内裤，牛粪……）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> 新西兰的【空气】和陌生人的【屁】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">08:39</a> 如果爱豆出售【洗澡水】，你会买吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 平台能买到【防弹背心】？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="774">12:54</a> 避雷【可视耳勺】！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 【假乳】初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a> 【答案之书】（猫猫吃饱饭版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1097">18:17</a> 高效【算卦】小道具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1169">19:29</a> 阿上买了10次【假发】，却几乎不戴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> 【变美】工具分享（欢迎交流！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1686">28:06</a> 南方孩子幸福感之“烦恼洗除中心”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a> 北方孩子必备的洗澡神器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2092">34:52</a> 智商税之【藏肉神器】【背背佳】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2255">37:35</a> 好物推荐之【人体工学椅】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2335">38:55</a> 智商税之【蒙面帽子】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 好物推荐之【头皮按摩梳】（挠痒痒版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2451">40:51</a> “脚是人的另一张脸”之足底好物大全！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2622">43:42</a> 治标不治本的【泰拳油】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2730">45:30</a> 失眠的人有福了！【安神香囊】（瘦子试用成功版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2839">47:19</a> 出行必备之【一次性高铁罩】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3038">50:38</a> 手机相关好物推荐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhqy470Gzw0GqRMBz0CxGuW24Ncq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lr3RqyMtsFDwhj8XNc6KTPjxm3f4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llBldUCrg7L_rdc41h4MAiVD70Eg.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
